WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.991
This is my simple calculator project.

00:00:03.271 --> 00:00:06.489
I enter two numbers, twelve and eight.

00:00:06.769 --> 00:00:10.357
Then I choose addition, and the answer is twenty.

00:00:10.637 --> 00:00:14.713
I can also subtract, multiply, or divide.

00:00:14.993 --> 00:00:19.505
The calculator checks the input and displays the result here.

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:23.237
That is the basic idea behind my calculator.
